/Title (This symposium reflects our continued commitment to providing a platform for educators and students and inductry practitioners to connect, exchange ideas, share experiences, and establish meaningful professional networks. This year's theme highlights the importance of human mediation in an ever-changing educational landscape shaped by technological innovation. As technology continues to transform education, we hope this symposium will encourage meaningful discussions on the enduring value of human connection, collaboration, empathy, and professional judgment in teaching and learning.)
